This branch is made to deposit your results and keep them

Here are the instructions to name the files.

Name the file like this : FieldType_Method_nbpoints_nbparticles_Interval.format



FieldType represents the magnetic field you are working on (Earth_perfect_dipole for example)

Method is the method used to solve the equation (RK4, Eu (Euler), DP (Dormand-Prince), Ad (Adams), Co (Colocation), Ve (Verlet))

nbpoints is the number of points typed like this : 2*105 represents 200000

nb particles is the number of particle with the same syntax

Interval is the interval typed like this : 0_1*104 represents [0, 10000]